# ============================================================================
# END OF AEROTUNNEL
# ============================================================================
# This plugin provides:
# ✅ True 6-DOF aerodynamic physics using Blade Element Theory
# ✅ GPU-accelerated force calculations (4 compute shaders)
# ✅ Wind tunnel editor with real-time visualization
# ✅ Dynamic debug lines (blue=lift, red=drag)
# ✅ Live telemetry dashboard (G-Force, Mach, Stall warnings)
# ✅ Works with any Skeletal or Static Mesh
# ✅ 120hz physics sub-stepping independent of framerate
# ✅ Real-world airfoil database (7 profiles: NACA 0012, 2412, 4412, Clark Y, etc.)
# ✅ Center of pressure and moment calculations
# ✅ Stall detection with audio/visual warnings
# ✅ Atmospheric turbulence simulation
# ✅ Vortex wake modeling
# ✅ Pressure coefficient visualization
# ✅ Flight regime detection (subsonic, transonic, supersonic, hypersonic)
# ✅ Compressibility corrections (Prandtl-Glauert)
# ✅ Reynolds number effects
# ✅ Complete editor UI (2 viewports, 2 details panels, toolbar, 5 Slate widgets)
# ✅ Real-time telemetry graphs (G-force, Mach, AoA history)
# ✅ CSV export for flight data analysis
# ✅ Blueprint integration for gameplay
# ✅ Menu entries and toolbar buttons
#
# Technical Features:
# - Blade Element Theory implementation
# - Lift coefficient: CL = CL_alpha * α (with stall modeling)
# - Drag coefficient: CD = CD_min + K * CL² (induced drag)
# - Dynamic pressure: q = 0.5 * ρ * V²
# - Mach number: M = V / a
# - Reynolds number: Re = V * c / ν
# - G-force: G = L / W
# - Stall speed: V_stall = sqrt((2 * W) / (ρ * S * CL_max))
# - Turn radius: R = V² / (g * tan(φ))
#
